0 FILE 10183 - 5 - Modern urban electric locomotive.ldr
0 Red and black modern electric locomotive with cabs at both ends, glazed cab windows, multi-color headlights, louvered grille vents, curved and sloped bodywork, a roof pantograph and two motorized bogies with buffers and magnetic couplings
0 Name: 10183 - 5 - Modern urban electric locomotive.ldr
0 Author: Bert Van Raemdonck [BEAVeR]
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
